{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57176","headline":"大乘赞十首 六 · 宝志","name":"大乘赞十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"内见外见緫恶，佛道魔道俱错。\n被此二大波旬，便即厌苦求乐。\n生死悟本体空，佛魔何处安着？\n只由妄情分别，前身後身孤薄。\n轮回六道不停，结业不能除却。\n所以流浪生死，皆由横生经略。\n身本虚无不实，返本是谁斟酌？\n有无我自能爲，不劳妄心卜度。\n衆生身同太虚，烦恼何处安着？\n但无一切希求，烦恼自然消落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}